{"n":112,"ayahs":[{"v":1,"ar":"قُلۡ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","en":"Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One","e2":"Say, ˹O Prophet,˺ “He is Allah—One ˹and Indivisible˺","tr":"Qul huwal laahu ahad","j":30},{"v":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","en":"Allah, the Eternal Refuge","e2":"Allah—the Sustainer ˹needed by all˺","tr":"Allah hus-samad","j":30},{"v":3,"ar":"لَمۡ يَلِدۡ وَلَمۡ يُولَدۡ","en":"He neither begets nor is born","e2":"He has never had offspring, nor was He born","tr":"Lam yalid wa lam yoolad","j":30},{"v":4,"ar":"وَلَمۡ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدُۢ","en":"Nor is there to Him any equivalent","e2":"And there is none comparable to Him.”","tr":"Wa lam yakul-lahu kufuwan ahad","j":30}]}